TITLE Calcite kinetic dissolution, hydrothermal, ask
SOLUTION 1
    temp      100
    pH        5    charge
    pe        4
    units     mmol/kgw
    C(4)      0.5
    Mn        1
    -water    1 # kg
KINETICS 1
    Calcite
        -formula   CaCO3 1
        -m0        1
        -parms    10.0 0.001
        -steps    10*10 90*11
RATES
Calcite
-start
10 REM: parms: specific surface area (SSA), rate constant k
20 SSA = PARM(1)
30 k   = PARM(2)
40 rate = k * SSA
50 moles = rate * TIME
60 SAVE moles
-end
SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -reset false
    -time               true
    -si                 Aragonite
USER_PUNCH
    -headings step
    10 PUNCH STEP_NO
END